2. A private [38;5;10mfp[0m module that pins each SSE destination operand with inline [38;5;10masm![0m, matching the instruction gcc emits at each site — read off [38;5;10mobjdump -d[0m of the C [38;5;10m.so[0m, site by site.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
Both are [38;5;10mcfg[0m-gated to x86-64 with a plain-arithmetic fallback elsewhere.[0m[0m
